<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Thank you for your subscription!</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    /* Reset styles */
    body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
    img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; height: auto; line-height: 100%; outline: none; text-decoration: none; display: block; }
    body { height: 100% !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; width: 100% !important; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }

    /* Layout Responsive */
    .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .logo { text-align: center; padding: 30px 0; }
    .logo img { max-width: 220px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero-image { width: 100%; }
    .hero-image img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
    .content-block { text-align: left; margin: 50px 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #000000; }
    .content-block h2 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 12px; }

    /* 2 Column Image Grid */
    .grid-container { width: 100%; margin: 50px 0; table-layout: fixed; padding: 0; }
    .grid-col a { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
    .grid-col a span { display: block; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 20px 0 24px; }
    .grid-col img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

    /* Footer */
    .footer { padding: 0; margin: 50px 0; }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .content-block { margin: 40px 0 !important; padding: 0 20px !important; }
      .grid-container { margin: 40px 0 !important; padding: 0 20px !important; }
      .footer { margin: 40px 0 !important; padding: 0 20px !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">

    <!-- 1. Header / Logo -->
    <div class="logo">
      <a href="{{ shop.url }}">
        {% if shop.email_logo_url %}
          <img src="{{ shop.email_logo_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="{{ shop.email_logo_width }}">
        {% else %}
          <h1 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; color: #000;">{{ shop.name }}</h1>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Hero Banner Image -->
    <div class="hero-image">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0501/5722/4124/files/RS27_Campaign_Look_09_0622_R3.png?v=1791792549" alt="Solace London Editorial">
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Text Content -->
    <div class="content-block">
      <p>Welcome to SOLACE.</p>
      <p>Solace London is a British womenswear brand founded by Laura Taylor and Ryan Holliday-Stevens in 2013. Longtime friends and collaborators, the duo share a dynamic background spanning design, production, retail, marketing and creative direction. Their combined sensibilities are visible in pieces that continuously blur the line between statement making and wearability.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. Two-Column Gallery Grid -->
    <table class="grid-container" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding-right:10px;" class="grid-col">
          <a href="https://www.solacelondon.com/collections/dresses">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0501/5722/4124/files/RS27_Campaign_Look_09_0622_R3_01.png?v=1791792438" alt="Lookbook 1">
            <span>Dresses</span>
          </a>
        </td>
        <td style="padding-left:10px;" class="grid-col">
          <a href="https://www.solacelondon.com/collections/bridal">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0501/5722/4124/files/RS27_Campaign_Look_09_0622_R3_02.png?v=1791792436" alt="Lookbook 2">
            <span>Bridal</span>
          </a>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- Footer Section -->
    <div class="footer">
      <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #000000; line-height: 1.5; table-layout: fixed;">
        <tr>
          <td align="left" style="padding-bottom: 30px;">
            <a href="https://www.solacelondon.com/collections/new-arrivals" style="color: #000000; text-decoration: none; margin-right: 20px;">New in</a>
            <a href="https://www.solacelondon.com/collections/icons" style="color: #000000; text-decoration: none;">Icons</a>
          </td>
          <td align="right" style="padding-bottom: 30px;">
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/solacelondon" style="color: #000000; text-decoration: none;">Instagram</a>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding-bottom: 30px;">
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
              <tr>
                <td style="border-top: 1px solid #000; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;">&nbsp;</td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td align="left" style="vertical-align: top;">
            <a href="https://www.solacelondon.com/pages/contact" style="color: #000000; text-decoration: none; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Contact us</a>
            <a href="https://www.solacelondon.com/pages/shipping-returns" style="color: #000000; text-decoration: none; display: block;">Shipping & Returns</a>
          </td>
          <td align="right" style="vertical-align: top;">
            <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color: #000000; text-decoration: none; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Unsubscribe</a>
            <span style="color: #000000; display: block;">Solace London, 21 Club Row, London, E2 7EY</span>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>